{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25396","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:31.317445+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I think, the best solution here is to do the following to make sure all ops inside `jnp.full` run on CPU:\r\n\r\n```\r\nwith jax.default_device(jax.devices('cpu')[0]):\r\n  a = jnp.full(shape=(40*(2**30)), fill_value=1.0, dtype=jnp.uint8)\r\n  print(a)\r\n# any op outside the scope will run on the TPU/GPU\r\n```","created_at":"2024-12-11T14:39:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25396#issuecomment-2536184214","id":2536184214,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25396","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6XKxmW","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2536184214/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-12-11T14:39:53Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2536184214","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"> I think, the best solution here is to do the following to make sure all ops inside `jnp.full` run on CPU:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> with jax.default_device(jax.devices('cpu')[0]):\r\n>   a = jnp.full(shape=(40*(2**30)), fill_value=1.0, dtype=jnp.uint8)\r\n>   print(a)\r\n> # any op outside the scope will run on the TPU/GPU\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nThat's a very good workaround!\r\n\r\nHowever I think the behaviour of jnp.full and similar API needs to be more faithful to their arguments then their global environments, especially if it can lead to OOM crashes","created_at":"2024-12-11T19:32:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25396#issuecomment-2536940173","id":2536940173,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25396","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6XNqKN","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2536940173/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-12-11T19:32:43Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2536940173","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25983708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmelumian972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmelumian972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmelumian972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmelumian972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zmelumian972","id":25983708,"login":"zmelumian972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTgzNzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmelumian972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmelumian972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmelumian972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us